WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,920
sister

2
00:00:00,920 --> 00:00:03,640
Can you give me supplies before you die?

3
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:05,440
I will pray for you

4
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:08,840
Maybe if you die you can return to the real world.

5
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:10,440
Marshmallow, I'll blind you

6
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:11,400
Do you see me?

7
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:14,560
Even if I die, I won't take advantage of you, crazy big brother.

8
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:16,280
Your words are on the ground

9
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:17,680
How about you give me the supplies?

10
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:19,800
I'll help you smash the marshmallows from now on

11
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:33,820
This is the limit that first-class vehicles can bear

12
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:35,620
There are still two hours and two minutes before the monster ebbs.

13
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:36,900
I only have one vehicle maintenance card

14
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:38,460
You have to survive four minutes on your own
